{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00726",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 11.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.48,
      "text": "Hello, Mr Evans, I'm Sue. I'll do your pulse and oxygen first, then the doctor. Oh, you've got your folder, well done. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.58,
      "end_seconds": 27.91,
      "duration_seconds": 14.33,
      "text": "Never go anywhere without it, love. I've been coming here since 2019, and I've seen four registrars and a locum who looked about twelve. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 41.72,
      "end_seconds": 44.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Pulse 76, oxygen 96 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.8,
      "end_seconds": 55.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "Good morning. It's your sarcoidosis follow-up, six months since last time. How have you been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.67,
      "end_seconds": 72.29,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "Well, my chest has been quiet, I get a bit of a cough in the mornings, that's all, and I'm on the steroids and the methotrexate, as you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.94,
      "end_seconds": 76.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Tell me about the cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.04,
      "end_seconds": 88.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "Dry, a few coughs when I get up, and then it's gone by breakfast. Nothing to worry about, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Good. Let's check the tablets, so I can match them to the record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.82,
      "end_seconds": 115.24,
      "duration_seconds": 15.42,
      "text": "Prednisolone, 5 mg once a day, down from 10 in the spring. And methotrexate, 10 mg once a week, on Sundays, with folic acid on Mondays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.67,
      "end_seconds": 123.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Right, that matches. And remind me of the other conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.03,
      "end_seconds": 136.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Sarcoidosis, since 2019, found on a chest X-ray, by accident, and osteoporosis, which they say is from the steroids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 137.79,
      "end_seconds": 142.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Doctor, do you want his bloods taken today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.93,
      "end_seconds": 155.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Yes, please, Sue. Mr Evans, since you're on methotrexate, we check your blood count, liver and kidneys every few months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.25,
      "end_seconds": 161.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Fair enough. Do I need to fast? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.79,
      "end_seconds": 176.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "No fasting. I'd also like you to have a chest X-ray, and a lung function test, to compare with last time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.53,
      "end_seconds": 184.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Oh, I do like the lung function, I blow so well. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 187.17,
      "end_seconds": 194.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "I'll book you in for the breathing test while you're here. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.45,
      "end_seconds": 203.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "How are your bones? Any aches, or have you had any falls? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.64,
      "end_seconds": 211.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "No falls. No fractures, since the one in 2021. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.49,
      "end_seconds": 220.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Good. You're also on the bone tablet and calcium, I see, so that's helpful. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.34,
      "end_seconds": 227.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yes, that's all in the folder. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.91,
      "end_seconds": 245.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.44,
      "text": "Overall, I'd say the sarcoidosis is well controlled, and possibly even in remission, as far as I can tell from how you are. But I'd like the tests to confirm it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.18,
      "end_seconds": 251.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Remission! That would be something. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.26,
      "end_seconds": 263.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "Let's not count chickens, we'll see the scans. Your steroid dose is already low, which is good. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.66,
      "end_seconds": 269.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Can I stop them altogether? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.34,
      "end_seconds": 281.72,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "Not on your own, please. If your results stay good, we can reduce them slowly over the next months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "I'll behave. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 286.27,
      "end_seconds": 292.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Mr Evans, shall I show you to the breathing room? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.02,
      "end_seconds": 301.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Lead on, Sue. And keep an eye on that registrar, he looked lost. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.36,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Noted. Take care, Mr Evans. ~"
    }
  ]
}
